<title>USA: Apple to &quot;spin off&quot; Newton unit - report.</title>
<headline>Apple to &quot;spin off&quot; Newton unit - report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Computer Inc will &quot;spin off&quot; its Newton unit as a separate wholly-owned subsidiary, according to an article in USA Today.</p>
<p>In April, Apple said that it is seeking outside investment in its Newton hand-held computer unit.</p>
<p>USA Today said that Apple decided to separate the unit so that it could benefit from renewed focus and more easily attract outsdie investors.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available for comment or clarification.</p>
</text>
